--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Nomos-v2 / NomosRealWeb dataset

Training data is generated from the public NomosRealWeb release (Nomos-v2 high
resolution images). No images from it are redistributed by this repository.
The dataset's own licence terms were not stated by its publisher at the time
of writing; see docs/PROVENANCE.md.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCRFD (InsightFace)

The face gate uses an SCRFD detector checkpoint, which is fetched at use time
and is not redistributed here.
